  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "I wanted PORYGON, but I was short\n",
        "by 100 Coins..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Whew...\r",
        "I’ve got to stay calm and collected...\r",
        "I can’t lose my cool.\n",
        "If I spend all my time playing here,\f",
        "I could get in trouble at home."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "I woke up and realized my potential!\r",
        "So, what potential was woken in me?\n",
        "What’s my hidden power, you ask?\r",
        "It’s a power that lets me see the\n",
        "Hidden Power of a Pokémon.\r",
        "When they learn that move, I can tell\n",
        "what type the move will be.\r",
        "So, want me to use my hidden power?\r",
        "I’ll tell you what type your\n",
        "Pokémon’s Hidden Power will be. {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll tell you what type your Pokémon’s\n",
        "Hidden Power will be.\r",
        "My own hidden power lets me\n",
        "do that. {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "If this Pokémon were to learn\n",
        "Hidden Power, the move’s type\f",
        "would be {STRVAR_1 15, 0, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "This Pokémon’s Hidden Power is the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 15, 0, 0} type."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "If you want to know, ask me, and I’ll\n",
        "activate my hidden power for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "A move that an Egg can learn?!\n",
        "That’s flat-out impossible."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, no. This Pokémon can’t learn the\n",
        "move Hidden Power in the first place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome!\r",
        "We exchange your game coins for\n",
        "fabulous prizes! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "OK. Please save your coins and\n",
        "come again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00011",
      "en_US": "Sorry! You need more coins. {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Is that right? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00013",
      "en_US": "Here you go!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00014",
      "en_US": "Sorry. You can’t carry any more.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Your party’s full!\n",
        "Please make some room\f",
        "before you come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00016",
      "en_US": "Would you like {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0509_T07R0501_00018",
